   "body": "[{\"id\":\"cZHOqrPaQO\",\"name\":\"The Temperance Movement (UK) \",\"start_time\":\"2026-10-29T17:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"concert\",\"country\",\"rock\"],\"tagsFlattened\":\"#concert #country #rock \",\"details\":\"Doors 6 PM\\nOn stage 8 PM\\n18+ (13+ w/legal guardian)\\n\\n---\\n\\n2025 marked the long-awaited return of The Temperance Movement after a five-year hiatus. What began as a small tour to test the waters quickly turned into a triumphant comeback, with venues upgraded and extra dates added across the UK and Europe. It proved one thing beyond doubt: the fans’ love for the band still burns brightly.\\n\\nNow, in 2026, rumours are swirling that work on the band’s next album is well underway, this time with a very special producer at the helm. With the ‘Let It All Out’ tour on the horizon, all signs point to an exciting new chapter for The Temperance Movement – back together and in the form of their lives.\\n\\n\\n\\n**Davey Horne**\\n\\nDavey Horne is a Scottish singer-songwriter, multi-instrumentalist and producer from Fife.\\n\\nSince releasing his self-titled debut album in 2020, Davey has built a reputation through both his own music and his work with other artists. He has toured extensively across the US, UK and Europe with New Jersey singer-songwriter Nicole Atkins, and was invited by Grammy-nominated producer Jonathan Wilson to join his UK and European tours. He has also worked with Jim Sclavunos of Nick Cave and the Bad Seeds and Grinderman.\\n\\nDavey is a member of Scottish folk-rock band Kassidy, and also works as a songwriter and producer. His writing credits include Nicole Atkins and Cammy Barnes, while his production work includes Barnes' Scottish country-folk single “Whiskey Roll”.\\n\\nAcross his own records and his work with others, Davey's strength lies in strong songwriting, musicianship and a voice that is immediately recognisable.\",\"custom_fields\":{\"end_time\":\"2026-10-29T23:00:00.000Z\",\"published\":true,\"age\":\"18+ (13+ w/ legal guardian)\",\"cover\":\"SEK 350\",\"coverCharge\":\"SEK 350\",\"type\":\"Concert\",\"facebookEvent\":\"\",\"ticketUrl\":\"https://www.nortic.se/ticket/show/340591\",\"freeEntry\":false,\"soldOut\":false,\"moreInfo\":\"\",\"eventStatus\":\"ONSALE\",\"onlineOnly\":false,\"ticketmasterId\":\"\",\"streamingLink\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"5mGALmFlHOA\",\"blurb\":\"\",\"secondaryTitle\":\"Support: Davey Horne (SCT)\",\"zone\":\"\",\"show_start_time\":\"2026-10-29T19:00:00.000Z\"},\"place\":{\"id\":\"MqFen6RaHG\",\"name\":\"Plan B - Malmö \",\"address\":\"Norra Grängesbergsgatan 26B\",\"city\":\"Malmö\",\"state\":\"Malmö\",\"country\":\"Sweden\",\"website\":\"https://www.planbmalmo.com/\",\"postal_code\":\"214 50\",\"latitude\":55.584110734703266,\"longitude\":13.027543481614178,\"custom_fields\":{\"ticketProvider\":\"Nortic\",\"ticketListingUrl\":\"https://www.nortic.se/ticket/organizer/2426\"},\"imagekit\":{\"fileId\":\"6ad21d8cead997d09a0e6e77\",\"name\":\"event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"size\":1026623,\"versionInfo\":{\"id\":\"6ad21d8cead997d09a0e6e77\",\"name\":\"Version 1\"},\"filePath\":\"/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"url\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"fileType\":\"image\",\"height\":1080,\"width\":1920,\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/tr:n-ik_ml_thumbnail/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"AITags\":null,\"description\":null},\"photo\":{\"urls\":{\"micro\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/abcdefg_4e7qjWSDp/tr:w-100\",\"small\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/abcdefg_4e7qjWSDp/tr:w-178\",\"medium\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/abcdefg_4e7qjWSDp/tr:w-375\"}}},\"imagekit\":{\"fileId\":\"6ad21d8cead997d09a0e6e77\",\"name\":\"event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"size\":1026623,\"versionInfo\":{\"id\":\"6ad21d8cead997d09a0e6e77\",\"name\":\"Version 1\"},\"filePath\":\"/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"url\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"fileType\":\"image\",\"height\":1080,\"width\":1920,\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/tr:n-ik_ml_thumbnail/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"AITags\":null,\"description\":null},\"photo\":{\"id\":\"6ad21d8cead997d09a0e6e77\",\"urls\":{\"small\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk/tr:w-178\",\"medium\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk/tr:w-375\",\"large\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk/tr:w-750\"}},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-16T12:52:11.713Z\"},{\"id\":\"Mlz5fWKMiz\",\"name\":\"Avantgardet\",\"start_time\":\"2026-10-30T17:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"Indie\",\"Rock\"],\"tagsFlattened\":\"#Indie #Rock \",\"details\":\"Doors 6 PM   \\nOn stage 8 PM   \\n18+ (13+ w/legal guardian)  \\n\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_  \\n\\n\\n**AVANTGARDET** \\n\\n\\n\\nEfter ett år med uppmärksammat nytt album, bejublade spelningar med Primal Scream, kritikerhyllade festivalframträdanden och en rad minnesvärda kvällar runt om i landet annonserar Avantgardet idag en ny höstturné. Efter ett intensivt halvår fortsätter bandet nu ut på vägarna med nya stopp, återbesök på välbekanta scener och flera möjligheter att möta publiken på nära håll. Och traditionsenligt avslutas året på hemmaplan.\\n\\n\\n\\nMed sin senaste skiva “United States av Sverige”, som togs emot med stort kritikerjubel i våras, har Avantgardet turnerat flitigt över hela landet. Sin vana trogen har bandet rört sig mellan mindre spelningar på rockklubbar och fritidsgårdar, gig tillsammans med Primal Scream och stora festivaler. GP beskrev bandets spelning på Block House Party i Göteborg som en stor höjdpunkt, och sommaren avslutades med högt uppskattade spelningar på Mosebacke i Stockholm och Trädgård de luxe i Växjö förra helgen.\\n\\n\\n\\nIdag startar Avantgardets höstturné i Älmhult samtidigt som sex nya datum adderas till turnéplanen. Turnén tar bandet vidare till bland annat två kvällar i Norge, Malmö, Huskvarna och Motala, innan året avslutas på hemmaplan i Kalmar. Där bjuder Avantgardet in till fest på det återöppnade Nöjespalatset Sandra – en legendarisk plats i Kalmars nöjesliv som dessutom besjöngs av bandet redan 2017 i genombrottssingeln “Fårskinnstearaway”. \\n\\n\\n\\n– Det fina är att många av arrangörerna på spelställena vi besöker vill boka oss igen redan innan vi hunnit trassla ut kablarna från scenen när vi spe\n…[afkortet]"
