   "url": "https://www.planbmalmo.com/_next/data/BGXMcDq1ubcDHY6E2d3H5/en/events/hip-hop-weekend-afterparty/IDKjycawi1.json?name=hip-hop-weekend-afterparty&id=IDKjycawi1",
