   "url": "https://www.planbmalmo.com/_next/data/BGXMcDq1ubcDHY6E2d3H5/en/events/super-jet-kinoko-jp/RHAxg3ac4K.json?name=super-jet-kinoko-jp&id=RHAxg3ac4K",
