   "status": 200,
   "ct": "application/json",
   "body": "{\"pageProps\":{\"postData\":{\"id\":\"q8g1YEHmaD\",\"name\":\"Fauna \",\"start_time\":\"2026-10-31T17:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"Global\",\"Psych\",\"Rock\"],\"tagsFlattened\":\"#Global #Psych #Rock \",\"details\":\"Doors 6 PM\\nOn stage 8 PM\\n18+ (13+ w/legal guardian)\\n\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\n\\n**CONCERT: Fauna**\\n\\nFauna conveys an organic, psychedelic, and dance-friendly experience. Their music functions as a meditative ritual where listeners find themselves encased in rhythms, dragged along through thorns and bushes by a forceful, volcanic pulse where time and space lose all meaning.\\n\\nSince bursting onto the scene in early 2023 with their acclaimed debut singles \\\"Animalisk\\\" and \\\"Cirkel,\\\" Fauna has been taking Europe by storm. They have shared festival stages across Scandinavia and mainland Europe—including Way Out West, Urkult, and PLX—alongside massive acts like Acid Arab, GOAT, and Föllakzoid.\\n\\nFresh off completing their highly anticipated debut album, the band is geared up for a busy 2026. Don't miss your chance to catch their driving, physical, and hypnotic live show in its purest element.\\n\\n**FOR FANS OF:** Goat, Acid Arab, Can, Altin Gün\",\"custom_fields\":{\"end_time\":\"2026-10-31T23:00:00.000Z\",\"published\":true,\"age\":\"\",\"cover\":\"SEK 195\",\"coverCharge\":\"SEK 195\",\"type\":\"Concert\",\"facebookEvent\":\"\",\"ticketUrl\":\"https://www.nortic.se/ticket/show/351950\",\"freeEntry\":false,\"soldOut\":false,\"moreInfo\":\"\",\"eventStatus\":\"ONSALE\",\"onlineOnly\":false,\"ticketmasterId\":\"\",\"streamingLink\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"DVDRNJamPes\",\"blurb\":\"\",\"secondaryTitle\":\"\",\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"name\":\"Fauna\",\"id\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/58BwrwQwopuQc4yX4w9cL0?si=bQGv-L0cS-u7JRH7d05iFw\"}],\"relatedEvents\":[],\"hideTimesOnSchedule\":false,\"zone\":\"\",\"show_start_time\":\"2026-10-31T19:00:00.000Z\"},\"place\":{\"id\":\"Mq