   "body": "{\"pageProps\":{\"postData\":{\"id\":\"kxqZ78jpF1\",\"name\":\"HOUSE NIGHT x Lynnée Denise x DONUTS\",\"start_time\":\"2026-10-30T22:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"hiphop\",\"dance\",\"house\"],\"tagsFlattened\":\"#hiphop #dance #house \",\"details\":\"HOUSE NIGHT x DONUTS\\n\\n‍‍As usual, it will be House night at Plan B. This year Lynnée Denise will take us on a journey and Dohnuts is back and badder than before!\\n\\nThe clubs during Hip Hop Weekend can only be described as legendary. Those who know, know!\\n\\nLYNNÉE DENISE\\n\\nMain Floor\\n\\nDJ Lynnée Denise will be spinning house music all night long from Chicago, Baltimore, New York, Detroit, and South Africa. Lynnée Denise is an award-winning author, cultural worker, curator, interdisciplinary artist, and PhD candidate at Goldsmiths, University of London. Originally from Los Angeles, California, and now based between Amsterdam and Johannesburg, her work explores the movement of Black cultural knowledge across borders through sound, language, archives, and Black Atlantic thought.\\n\\nDONUTS\\n\\nWarehouse Floor\",\"custom_fields\":{\"end_time\":\"2026-10-31T02:00:00.000Z\",\"published\":true,\"age\":\"18\",\"cover\":\"150 kr + fees\",\"coverCharge\":\"150 kr + fees\",\"type\":\"Club\",\"facebookEvent\":\"\",\"ticketUrl\":\"https://secure.tickster.com/sv/wrcv36wwhzf0528/900nzu2rlg7ulx6/products\",\"freeEntry\":false,\"soldOut\":false,\"moreInfo\":\"\",\"eventStatus\":\"ONSALE\",\"onlineOnly\":false,\"ticketmasterId\":\"\",\"streamingLink\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"\",\"blurb\":\"\",\"secondaryTitle\":\"\",\"embeds\":[],\"relatedEvents\":[],\"hideTimesOnSchedule\":false,\"zone\":\"\",\"show_start_time\":\"\"},\"place\":{\"id\":\"MqFen6RaHG\",\"name\":\"Plan B - Malmö \",\"address\":\"Norra Grängesbergsgatan 26B\",\"city\":\"Malmö\",\"state\":\"Malmö\",\"country\":\"Sweden\",\"website\":\"https://www.planbmalmo.com/\",\"postal_code\":\"214 50\",\"latitude\":55.584110734703266,\"longitude\":13.027543481614178,