   "ct": "application/json",
   "body": "{\"pageProps\":{\"postData\":{\"id\":\"cZHOqrPaQO\",\"name\":\"The Temperance Movement (UK) \",\"start_time\":\"2026-10-29T17:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"concert\",\"country\",\"rock\"],\"tagsFlattened\":\"#concert #country #rock \",\"details\":\"Doors 6 PM\\nOn stage 8 PM\\n18+ (13+ w/legal guardian)\\n\\n---\\n\\n2025 marked the long-awaited return of The Temperance Movement after a five-year hiatus. What began as a small tour to test the waters quickly turned into a triumphant comeback, with venues upgraded and extra dates added across the UK and Europe. It proved one thing beyond doubt: the fans’ love for the band still burns brightly.\\n\\nNow, in 2026, rumours are swirling that work on the band’s next album is well underway, this time with a very special producer at the helm. With the ‘Let It All Out’ tour on the horizon, all signs point to an exciting new chapter for The Temperance Movement – back together and in the form of their lives.\\n\\n\\n\\n**Davey Horne**\\n\\nDavey Horne is a Scottish singer-songwriter, multi-instrumentalist and producer from Fife.\\n\\nSince releasing his self-titled debut album in 2020, Davey has built a reputation through both his own music and his work with other artists. He has toured extensively across the US, UK and Europe with New Jersey singer-songwriter Nicole Atkins, and was invited by Grammy-nominated producer Jonathan Wilson to join his UK and European tours. He has also worked with Jim Sclavunos of Nick Cave and the Bad Seeds and Grinderman.\\n\\nDavey is a member of Scottish folk-rock band Kassidy, and also works as a songwriter and producer. His writing credits include Nicole Atkins and Cammy Barnes, while his production work includes Barnes' Scottish country-folk single “Whiskey Roll”.\\n\\nAcross his own records and his work with others, Davey's strength lies in strong songwriting, musicianship and a voice that is immediately recognisable.\",\"custom_fields\":{\"end_time\":\"2026-10-29T23:00:00.000Z\",\"published\":true,\"age\":\"18+ (13+ w/ legal guardian)\",\"cover\":\"SEK 350\",\"coverCharge\":\"SEK 350\",\"type\":\"Concert\",\"facebookEvent\":\"\",\"ticketUrl\":\"https://www.nortic.se/ticket/show/340591\",\"freeEntry\":false,\"soldOut\":false,\"moreInfo\":\"\",\"eventStatus\":\"ONSALE\",\"onlineOnly\":false,\"ticketmasterId\":\"\",\"streamingLink\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"5mGALmFlHOA\",\"blurb\":\"\",\"secondaryTitle\":\"Support: Davey Horne (SCT)\",\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"name\":\"The Temperance Movement\",\"id\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/3SUI6pbPumjijbLHHY6vss?si=Egn7WxNkSJa47LN59ebRXg\"}],\"relatedEvents\":[],\"hideTimesOnSchedule\":false,\"zone\":\"\",\"show_start_time\":\"2026-10-29T19:00:00.000Z\"},\"place\":{\"id\":\"MqFen6RaHG\",\"name\":\"Plan B - Malmö \",\"address\":\"Norra Grängesbergsgatan 26B\",\"city\":\"Malmö\",\"state\":\"Malmö\",\"country\":\"Sweden\",\"website\":\"https://www.planbmalmo.com/\",\"postal_code\":\"214 50\",\"latitude\":55.584110734703266,\"longitude\":13.027543481614178,\"custom_fields\":{\"ticketProvider\":\"Nortic\",\"ticketListingUrl\":\"https://www.nortic.se/ticket/organizer/2426\"},\"imagekit\":{\"fileId\":\"6ad21d8cead997d09a0e6e77\",\"name\":\"event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"size\":1026623,\"versionInfo\":{\"id\":\"6ad21d8cead997d09a0e6e77\",\"name\":\"Version 1\"},\"filePath\":\"/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"url\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"fileType\":\"image\",\"height\":1080,\"width\":1920,\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/tr:n-ik_ml_thumbnail/venues/event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"AITags\":null,\"description\":null},\"photo\":{\"urls\":{\"micro\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/abcdefg_4e7qjWSDp/tr:w-100\",\"small\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/abcdefg_4e7qjWSDp/tr:w-178\",\"medium\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/abcdefg_4e7qjWSDp/tr:w-375\"}}},\"imagekit\":{\"fileId\":\"6ad21d8cead997d09a0e6e77\",\"name\":\"event_Qi54p5MGk\",\"size\"