   "body": "{\"pageProps\":{\"postData\":{\"id\":\"Roq2EBpDdv\",\"name\":\"Boris (JP) \",\"start_time\":\"2026-11-07T17:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"metal\",\"psych\",\"rock\"],\"tagsFlattened\":\"#metal #psych #rock \",\"details\":\"Doors 6 PM\\nOn stage 8 PM\\n18+ (13+ w/legal guardian)\\n\\n---\\n\\nBrace yourself, the flood is coming.  \\n  \\nJapanese sludge trio BORIS is going on tour to celebrate the 20th anniversary of their album “Pink” which Pitchfork referred to as “their most melodic, conventionally structured, and aggressively addictive LP to date”. Since then they have released an ocean of new music, never faltering or straying from their ambient, sludge core but always surprising.  \\n  \\nIn 2000 they released their single “flood”, a 70 minute song that feels more like a cinematic masterpiece than simply just a song. With BORIS it’s never just a song, it’s a journey, storytelling and genius.  \\n  \\nComing to Plan B November 7!  \\nWith special guest: Planning For Burial\",\"custom_fields\":{\"end_time\":\"2026-11-07T23:00:00.000Z\",\"published\":true,\"age\":\"\",\"cover\":\"SEK 270\",\"coverCharge\":\"SEK 270\",\"type\":\"Concert\",\"facebookEvent\":\"\",\"ticketUrl\":\"https://www.nortic.se/ticket/show/345653\",\"freeEntry\":false,\"soldOut\":false,\"moreInfo\":\"\",\"eventStatus\":\"ONSALE\",\"onlineOnly\":false,\"ticketmasterId\":\"\",\"streamingLink\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"PdkcZlmwrYw\",\"blurb\":\"\",\"secondaryTitle\":\"Support: Planning For Burial [US]\",\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"name\":\"Boris\",\"id\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/3EgMK920cIH5aLxFnJ6zSi?si=jmeenqPSSai-EiswUQ10Lw\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"name\":\"Planning For Burial\",\"id\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/4nhaUpMjrBW8vywsP2yzzD?si=k2LzuQeNTpiCrto4_BYsaw\"}],\"relatedEvents\":[],\"hideTimesOnSchedule\":false,\"zone\":\"\",\"show_start_time\":\"2026-11-07T19:00:00.000Z\"},\"place\":{\"id\":\"MqFen6RaHG\",\"name\":\"Plan B - Malmö \",\"address\":\"Norra Grängesber