   "ct": "application/json",
   "body": "{\"pageProps\":{\"postData\":{\"id\":\"jNKbxx3NPJ\",\"name\":\"Cola (CA) \",\"start_time\":\"2026-11-16T17:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"postpunk\",\"indie\",\"freeformembers\"],\"tagsFlattened\":\"#postpunk #indie #freeformembers \",\"details\":\"**CONCERT: Cola (CA)**\\n\\nDirect from Montreal’s thriving indie scene, Cola lands at Plan B for a night of razor-sharp post-punk and hypnotic grooves. Formed by Tim Darcy and Ben Stidworthy following the dissolution of the iconic band Ought, Cola has rapidly cemented their reputation as one of the most vital names in the genre.\\n\\nTheir sound is stripped back yet powerful. Drawing inspiration from the DIY ethics of the Dischord era and the poetic precision of David Berman, Cola constructs tracks where every guitar scratch and drum beat serves a definitive purpose. It’s music for those who crave the nervous energy of The Strokes, the intellectual art-pop of Talking Heads, and the uncompromising grit of modern guitar music.\\n\\nIn May 2026, the band released their third album, Cost of Living Adjustment, hailed by critics as their most accomplished work to date. It is complex, beautifully restless, and utterly undeniable in a live setting.\\n\\nDon't miss the chance to catch one of the world's tightest live units at Plan B.\\n\\n**Secrecy (DK)**\\n\\nSecrecy is a dream pop duo from Copenhagen, Denmark, consisting of Tobias Guldborg Tarp and Emil Zethsen. Both members of the acclaimed post-punk group Yung, their musical partnership flourished anew in the early 2020’s - swiftly and naturally - as they pursued a different, more delicate and dreamy sonic path.\\n\\n\\n\\nSecrecy released their debut album ‘Scenes From a Daydream’ in April 2025 via the Copenhagen based label Part Time Records. They are currently working on a follow-up EP. Live, Secrecy performs as a 4-piece. \\n\\n\\n\\n&nbsp;\",\"custom_fields\":{\"end_time\":\"2026-11-16T23:00:00.000Z\",\"published\":true,\"age\":\"18+ (13+ w/ legal guardian)\",\"cover\":\"SEK 150\",\"coverCharge\":\"SEK 150\",\"type\":\"Concert\",\"facebookEvent\":\"\",\"ticketUrl\":\"https://www.nortic.se/ticket/show/329710\",\"freeEntry\":false,\"soldOut\":false,\"moreInfo\":\"\",\"eventStatus\":\"ONSALE\",\"onlineOnly\":false,\"ticketmasterId\":\"\",\"streamingLink\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"IBwfQcYH14M\",\"blurb\":\"\",\"secondaryTitle\":\"+ Secrecy (DK) FREE FOR MEMBERS!\",\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"name\":\"Cola\",\"id\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/1KCSUZBJy1bAsIz7wUYkd8?si=RohBonm-T6KwrzC8Ayae2g\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"name\":\"Secrecy\",\"id\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/7pYWQhiVMRa69m0qi15yj1?si=PrbyqW7cTXuw13Ra-LvQvQ\"}],\"relatedEvents\":[],\"hideTimesOnSchedule\":false,\"zone\":\"\",\"show_start_time\":\"2026-11-16T19:00:00.000Z\"},\"place\":{\"id\":\"MqFen6RaHG\",\"name\":\"Plan B - Malmö \",\"address\":\"Norra Grängesbergsgatan 26B\",\"city\":\"Malmö\",\"state\":\"Malmö\",\"country\":\"Sweden\",\"website\":\"https://www.planbmalmo.com/\",\"postal_code\":\"214 50\",\"latitude\":55.584110734703266,\"longitude\":13.027543481614178,\"custom_fields\":{\"ticketProvider\":\"Nortic\",\"ticketListingUrl\":\"https://www.nortic.se/ticket/organizer/2426\"},\"imagekit\":{\"fileId\":\"6ac3855aead997d09a3a70e3\",\"name\":\"event_JQe2295I_\",\"size\":780727,\"versionInfo\":{\"id\":\"6ac3855aead997d09a3a70e3\",\"name\":\"Version 1\"},\"filePath\":\"/venues/event_JQe2295I_\",\"url\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/event_JQe2295I_\",\"fileType\":\"image\",\"height\":1080,\"width\":1920,\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/tr:n-ik_ml_thumbnail/venues/event_JQe2295I_\",\"AITags\":null,\"description\":null},\"photo\":{\"urls\":{\"micro\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/abcdefg_4e7qjWSDp/tr:w-100\",\"small\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/abcdefg_4e7qjWSDp/tr:w-178\",\"medium\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/abcdefg_4e7qjWSDp/tr:w-375\"}}},\"imagekit\":{\"fileId\":\"6a