8/11/26 \",\"image\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/event_qSt08Gb3W\",\"link\":\"jonas-lundqvist/Kb6MdlCqKx\",\"ticketLink\":\"https://www.nortic.se/ticket/show/349529\"},{\"objectId\":\"mXowEmMFc8\",\"type\":\"event\",\"title\":\"LKN\",\"info\":\"28/11/26 \",\"image\":\"https://ik.imagekit.io/mfgbmrqfuvo/venues/event_KsH3SwKXl\",\"link\":\"lkn/mXowEmMFc8\",\"ticketLink\":\"https://nortic.se/ticket/show/357712\"},{\"objectId\":\"eNf3tPquGi\",\"type\":\"e\n…[afkortet]"
