   "body": "{\"pageProps\":{\"postData\":{\"id\":\"nsIVBYsqeh\",\"name\":\"Rotting Christ (GR)\",\"start_time\":\"2026-11-14T17:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"black metal\",\"metal\"],\"tagsFlattened\":\"#black metal #metal \",\"details\":\"Doors 6 PM\\n\\nGrand Harvest 8 PM  \\nRotting Christ 9 PM  \\n  \\n18+ (13+ w/legal guardian)  \\n\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\\\_\\n\\nThe Greek legends of black metal return to Malmö! With over three decades of sonic blasphemy behind them, **Rotting Christ** brings their ritualistic atmosphere and melodic granduer to the intimate stage of **Plan B**.\\n\\nExpect a journey through their massive discography—from the primitive roots of *Thy Mighty Contract* to the soaring, gothic anthems of *Pro Xristou*.\\n\\nSupport: Swedish death/black metal band Grand Harvest\",\"custom_fields\":{\"end_time\":\"2026-11-14T23:00:00.000Z\",\"published\":true,\"age\":\"\",\"cover\":\"SEK 395\",\"coverCharge\":\"SEK 395\",\"type\":\"Concert\",\"facebookEvent\":\"\",\"ticketUrl\":\"https://www.nortic.se/ticket/show/337314\",\"freeEntry\":false,\"soldOut\":false,\"moreInfo\":\"\",\"eventStatus\":\"ONSALE\",\"onlineOnly\":false,\"ticketmasterId\":\"\",\"streamingLink\":\"\",\"youtube\":\"j7HR_oL6uqQ\",\"blurb\":\"\",\"secondaryTitle\":\"Support: Grand Harvest\",\"embeds\":[{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"name\":\"Rotting Christ\",\"id\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/7FhkwcO8Jd7BRWdllBpXBJ?si=wzfa3VjSRxiwVn_n025Y1g\"},{\"type\":\"spotify\",\"name\":\"Grand Harvest\",\"id\":\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/4gOGYhBbgzn6FaWZfQ52I2?si=aEPHUB-6QtSEwBoW2UqqwQ\"}],\"relatedEvents\":[],\"hideTimesOnSchedule\":false,\"zone\":\"\",\"show_start_time\":\"2026-11-14T18:00:00.000Z\"},\"place\":{\"id\":\"MqFen6RaHG\",\"name\":\"Plan B - Malmö \",\"address\":\"Norra Grängesbergsgatan 26B\",\"city\":\"Malmö\",\"state\":\"Malmö\",\"country\":\"Sweden\",\"website\":\"https://www.planbmalmo.com/\",\"postal_code\":\"214 50\",\"latit