   "url": "https://www.planbmalmo.com/_next/data/BGXMcDq1ubcDHY6E2d3H5/en/events/jul-med-franska-trion/8NiNiMqD4s.json?name=jul-med-franska-trion&id=8NiNiMqD4s",
